From: devlink-rescue
Subject: ntreg.h: include stdint.h

ntreg.h declares int32_t fields without including <stdint.h>, which glibc
supplies by accident through other headers and musl does not.

Upstream is inactive (last release 140201); not sent.

--- a/ntreg.h	2026-09-25 18:42:03.321055655 -0500
+++ b/ntreg.h	2026-09-25 18:42:03.322388045 -0500
@@ -25,6 +25,8 @@
 #ifndef _INCLUDE_NTREG_H
 #define _INCLUDE_NTREG_H 1
 
+#include <stdint.h>
+
 #define SZ_MAX     4096       /* Max unicode strlen before we truncate */
 
 #define KEY_ROOT   0x2c         /* Type ID of ROOT key node */
